[I] VSphere CLI built on top of govmomi

[T] VSphere CLI built on top of govmomi.

[U] https://github.com/vmware/govmomi/tree/master/govc

[A] Govc Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS
[R] + arm arm64 loongarch64 mips mips64 powerpc64 riscv64 s390x x86 x86-64

[L] APL
[V] 0.56.1

[D] 7b5176c5a036144cbcc8a8f58d37743dbe91cdc93d184d6e851048ac govc-0.56.1.tar.gz https://github.com/vmware/govmomi/archive/v0.56.1/

. $base/package/*/*/go-conf.in

rungo=0 srcdir=gov*/govc

var_append makeopt ' ' all
hook_add postmake 5 'install -v govc* $root$bindir/govc'
